          "id": "1769765567308",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769765567310_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Review the output of the CREATE_BATCH_TEMPORARY_CARDS and REPLENISH_TEMPORARY_KANBAN_CARDS  business object. You have the following context:\n1. {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_BATCH_TEMPORARY_CARDS.$output}} = response of the POST API call to generate the temporary kanban cards\n2. {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_BATCH_TEMPORARY_CARDS.$status}} = the status of the Rest API call to generate the temporary kanban cards\n3. {{$context.$nodes.REPLENISH_TEMPORARY_KANBAN_CARDS.$output}} = response of the POST API call to replenish the generated temporary kanban cards\n4. {{$context.$nodes.REPLENISH_TEMPORARY_KANBAN_CARDS.$status}} = the status of the Rest API call to replenish the generated temporary kanban cards\n\n\n- If the temporary Kanban card was created  and replenished successfully, return a simple message summarizing the key details of the new card (including the card number and relevant attributes).\n- DO NOT display any id(s) or identifiers.\n- If the creation or replenishment failed, return a clear message explaining the reason for the failure based on the output.\n\nOnly provide the relevant success or failure message, with no extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
