        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get count of shortages",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const input = $context.$nodes.GET_ALL_PULL_SEQUENCE_SUMMARIES_BY_ITEM.$output;\nconst items = Array.isArray(input?.items) ? input.items : [];\n\nconst itemNumber = items[0]?.ItemNumber ?? null;\nconst thresholdRaw = parseFloat($context.$variables.threshold);\nconst threshold = Number.isFinite(thresholdRaw) ? thresholdRaw : 0;\n\nconst filtered = itemNumber ? items.filter(r => r?.ItemNumber === itemNumber) : items;\n\nconst totalPullSequences = new Set(\n  filtered.map(r => r?.PullSequenceId).filter(id => id != null && String(id).trim() !== \"\")\n).size;\n\nlet shortagePullSequences = 0;\n\nfor (const r of filtered) {\n  const pctDiffTotalNum = Number.isFinite(Number(r?.PctDiffTotal)) ? Number(r.PctDiffTotal) : 0;\n  const pctDiffFullNum = Number.isFinite(Number(r?.PctDiffFull)) ? Number(r.PctDiffFull) : 0;\n\n  if (pctDiffTotalNum > threshold || pctDiffFullNum > threshold) {\n    shortagePullSequences += 1;\n  }\n}\n\nreturn { shortagePullSequences, totalPullSequences };\n"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769753304869"
          },
          "code": "GET_COUNT_OF_SHORTAGES",
          "id": "1774263106564",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Pull Sequence Id"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769765430485"
          },
          "code": "GET_PULL_SEQUENCE_ID",
          "id": "1775457214714",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775457214716_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a strict parsing agent.\n\nInput:\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraAction}}\n\nYour task is to extract:\n- Action\n- PullSequenceId\n\nReturn exactly this object:\n\n{\n  \"Action\": \"<action>\",\n  \"PullSequenceId\": \"<pullSequenceId>\"\n}\n\nRules:\n\n1. Input can be any format (string, JSON string, or object-like string).\n\n2. Action extraction:\n   - Look specifically for one of these exact values anywhere in the input:\n     - replenishKanbanCards\n     - generateTemporaryKanbanCard\n   - If found, use it as Action.\n\n3. PullSequenceId extraction:\n   - Look for numeric value associated with any of these keys:\n     - PullSequenceId\n     - pullSequenceId\n     - pullSequenceID\n   - OR if input is hyphen-separated (ACTION-ID), take the value after the first hyphen.\n   - Always return PullSequenceId as a string.\n\n4. Fallback:\n   - If PullSequenceId is found but Action is not found, set:\n     Action = \"replenishKanbanCards\"\n\n5. If PullSequenceId cannot be found, return:\n\n{\n  \"Action\": \"\",\n  \"PullSequenceId\": \"\"\n}\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not add explanations\n- Do not add markdown\n- Do not add extra fields\n- Do not change casing\n- Do not guess values beyond the rules"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Builld Return Message",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let activeKanbanCardNumbers = [];\nlet data = $context.$nodes.GET_ALL_KANBAN_CARDS_FOR_PULLSEQUENCE_ID.$output;\nlet returnMessage = \"\";\n\nactiveKanbanCardNumbers = data.items.filter(card => card.CardStatusMeaning === \"Active\").map(card => card.KanbanCardNumber);\nactiveKanbanCardNumbers = [...new Set(activeKanbanCardNumbers)];\n\nif (activeKanbanCardNumbers.length ==0 ){\n      returnMessage = \"No Kanban cards are currently associated with this pull sequence, so replenishment can’t be triggered. Please create Kanban cards, then try again.\"\n}\nelse {\n      returnMessage = \"There are no Kanban cards in the New state for this pull sequence, so replenishment cannot be initiated. Please create Kanban cards and try again.\"\n}\n\nreturn returnMessage;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773730796301"
          },
          "code": "BUILLD_RETURN_MESSAGE",
          "id": "1775547189225",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Number of required temporary cards",
            "returnType": "number",
            "sourceCode": "const pullSequenceSummaries = $context.$nodes.GET_ALL_PULL_SEQUENCE_SUMMARIES_BY_ITEM.$output.items;\nconst pullSequenceId = $context.$nodes.GET_PULL_SEQUENCE_ID.$output.PullSequenceId;\n\n// Find the matching record\nconst record = pullSequenceSummaries.find(\n  r => String(r.PullSequenceId) === String(pullSequenceId)\n);\n\n// Default values if not found or missing\nconst numberOfCards = record && record.NumberOfCards != null ? parseFloat(record.NumberOfCards) : 0;\nconst fullCards = record && record.FullCards != null ? parseFloat(record.FullCards) : 0;\nconst temporaryCards = record && record.TemporaryCards != null ? parseFloat(record.TemporaryCards) : 0;\n\n// Handle NaN cases\nconst nCards = isNaN(numberOfCards) ? 0 : numberOfCards;\nconst fCards = isNaN(fullCards) ? 0 : fullCards;\nconst tCards = isNaN(temporaryCards) ? 0 : temporaryCards;\n\n// Calculate required temporary cards\nlet requiredTemporaryCards = (0.8 * nCards) - (fCards + tCards);\n\nrequiredTemporaryCards = Math.max(0, Math.ceil(requiredTemporaryCards));\nreturn requiredTemporaryCards;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775656042353"
          },
          "code": "NUMBER_OF_REQUIRED_TEMPORARY_CARDS",
          "id": "1775655355358",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
